==English==
===Verb===
'''to signify''' (''transitive'' or ''intransitive'')
# to give (something) a [[meaning]] or an [[importance]]
# to [[show]] one's [[intention]]s with a [[sign]] etc
# (slang) an overt or implicit display of one's freedom in the presence of inmates or convicts. 

